    reef: { cell: 22, chance: 0.5, margin: 6, radius: [2.5, 5.5], height: [2, 6], canopyMin: 3.5, canopyChance: 0.5, trunk: 1.3, droop: 2, topChance: 0.5 },
    // The rest of the floor (abyssRules lifeOps): on a floor at or under `deep`, a sea lantern set in it (`lantern` of
