      liked: ["Now THAT is a gift! You're going in the credits, mate.", "You beauty! I'm unboxing this one on stream."],
      disliked: ["Did this come off a farm? I can smell the paddock from here.", "I'll... put it with the others. Cheers. I think."],
      giftTags: { "technology": "Ooh, gear! This is going straight in the next video, mate.", "animals": "For the animals? You legend. They'll love it. I'll tell them it's from me.", "farming": "Farm stuff? Mate, I film lions, not lettuce.", "vegetables": "A vegetable. Grown in dirt. I'll pass, cheers.", "carrots": "A carrot? Do I look like I live in a hutch?", "fruit": "Fruit off a farm? Not for me, mate. Give it to a monkey." },
      // said to his stream at each stop, {species} when animals are in front of him
      stream: ["What's up, legends! We are LIVE at the zoo, and you will not believe what's behind me.", "Smash that like button if you can see the {species}. Smash it anyway.", "Chat's asking if the {species} bite. Only one way to find out! Kidding. Mostly.", "This {species} and I go way back. Don't we, mate? See, it nodded.", "Welcome back to the channel! Today: the {species}. Tomorrow: who knows. I certainly don't.", "Chat, say g'day to the {species}! They can't read, but it's the thought that counts.", "Look at this beauty. No, behind me. Well, also me.", "Biggest crowd I've had all week, legends. Give yourselves a wave!", "New subscriber! Welcome, mate. The {species} say welcome too. In their own way.", "Let me get the angle right. There. Me, the {species}, pure cinema."],
      // 0.1.223 (stage C): chats, gifts and following
