      late: ["Look at the time! I've got class tomorrow. Goodnight! Sorry. Goodnight, quietly."],
      lost: ["I can't get over there! I'll wait here. On the dry part."],
      workGift: ["Had a spare one of these left over from class. It's yours. It's not homework, I promise.", "Here! From my classroom. I made too many. I always make too many."],
