      teach: ["{name}! Sit anywhere. Not there, that's the cat's. CLASS IS IN SESSION!", "Welcome, {name}! Today's lesson is a good one. I haven't picked it yet, but it's a good one.", "{name}, right on time! I baked for the occasion. Learning first, muffins after."],
