      home: ["Welcome to the classroom! It's also my kitchen. And my living room. The cat's on the good chair.", "I'm baking and marking papers. One of them's going well. It's the baking."],
      leaving: ["Off to the zoo! Class trip! It's just me. Still counts.", "Zoo time! I'm going to see the cats. And stay well away from the tanks."],
