      asleep: ["ZZZ... pop quiz... zzz... no dogs..."],
      waiting: ["MY HOUSE! My classroom! My oven! I'll wait right here until it's fixed. Is the cat okay?"],
      likes: ["Fishing, baseball, baking and a cat on my lap. Loud music, too. That's living!", "Video games! I'm creative at them. I lose in ways nobody's thought of."],
