      lost: ["Oh dear, I can't follow you there. I'll wait here with this nice patch of clover."],
      workGift: ["I gathered a little extra at my research plot. Please take it, it's all earth-friendly.", "Here, from my research. Nothing was harmed to make it, I checked twice."],
      rewardPortable: ["I drew these up for you: plans for a Portable Disposery. It takes away what can't be reused, and nothing else. Use it kindly."],
      rewardDisposery: ["You've earned my best work: plans for a Disposery, a whole bin of tidy nothing. Promise me you'll compost what you can first."],
      rewardAgain: ["You've none left? That's quite all right, I keep copies. I checked them twice. Here you are."],
      // 0.1.244: at work
      work: ["My research plot is calling. The compost won't test itself, sweet as it is. Goodbye for now!"],
      toWork: ["Off to my research plot! There's a whole world to tidy.", "Research time. I do hope my compost missed me."],
      working: ["This compost is coming along beautifully. Smell that! No? Just me?", "Sorting litter. This pile can be reused, this pile can't. I sorted it twice to be sure.", "Grow well, little sprout. I believe in you. I'm writing that in my notes."],
      fromWork: ["A good day's research. The world is a tiny bit cleaner than it was this morning.", "All done. Soil under my fingernails and hope in my heart."],
      found: ["There you are! I was talking to a daisy and never noticed you'd gone."],
      hello: ["Hello, dear friend! Isn't the world green today?", "Oh, hello! Careful where you step, there's a beetle crossing just there."],
