      leaving: ["I'm off to the zoo to see how the animals are feeling today.", "Time to visit the zoo! I hope the paths are tidy and the animals content."],
      visiting: ["Happy animals in clean homes. That's all I ever wish for.", "So many living things in one place! I want to thank each of them for being here."],
      returning: ["What a day. I said hello to every animal. I may have missed a fish, so I'll go back.", "Home again, with grass stains on my gown. Worth it."],
