      intro: ["Guido. I collect bows. That's it. That's all I do. Don't ask about the other thing. There is no other thing."],
      friend: ["You're all right, you know that? You're one of the good ones. I keep a list.", "Friend of mine, friend of the family. The bow family. It's a hobby club."],
      close: ["You know how to keep quiet. In my line of work, that's worth more than gold. My line of work is bows. Obviously.", "I trust you. I don't trust anybody, so that's a big deal. Don't make it a thing.", "The family business? It's bows. We collect them. We keep them safe. Some people need their bows kept very, very safe.", "That Ballista? Belonged to a guy who owed some money. He doesn't owe it any more. He also doesn't have a Ballista any more.", "The family's been in bows for three generations. My grandfather started with one Longbow and a very persuasive smile."],
      rain: ["Rain. On this suit? No. I'll stay under the awning and look good."],
