      caseLook: ["Look, don't touch. Each one of these has a story. None of the stories are true.", "My collection. Fifteen of the finest, give or take. Mostly give.", "Beautiful, aren't they? I polish them every night. It's relaxing. Very legitimate."],
      caseNone: ["Where would I put it? I need a Bow Case. In my house. Glass all round, so I can admire them.", "No case, no bow. A collector has standards."],
      caseFull: ["The case is full. Twenty-seven bows. Even I have limits. Trade me one out first."],
