      // 0.1.264: his upgrades (guido/bowCase.js)
      upgradeLook: ["Every bow has more in it. I know where. For a fair fee. Very fair.", "Signature first, then I tune it. One step at a time. Craftsmanship.", "Hand it over. Gently. I'm an artist."],
      upgradeDone: ["There. Better than new. Don't ask what I did. Trade secret.", "Finished. If anyone asks, it was always like that.", "Done. Treat her well. She'll know if you don't."],
      again: ["One gift a day. I'm a disciplined man. Come back tomorrow."],
      workGift: ["Take this. A gift from my associates. Very generous people, my associates. It's a bow club.", "A little something for you. Don't ask where it's from. It's from a shop. A real shop."],
      follow: ["Fine, I'll walk with you. Not behind you. With you. I don't walk behind anybody."],
